  {
   "id": "pax",
   "text": "What followed was the Pax Romana, the Roman Peace: about two hundred years of relative peace and stability inside the empire. Trade boomed. Cities grew. And Rome itself became the greatest city in the Western world, home to perhaps a million people.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "era",
