   "id": "day",
   "text": "Picture Rome around one hundred AD. Crowds pour into the Forum to shop, gossip and argue about politics. Water flows from public fountains, fed by long aqueducts. People meet at the public baths. At the Circus Maximus, fans cheer chariot races. And at the Colosseum, opened in eighty AD, some fifty thousand spectators watch the games.",
