   "id": "cracks",
   "text": "Then the cracks appeared. Between two thirty-five and two eighty-four AD, more than twenty men claimed the title of emperor, and most of them were murdered or died in battle. Plague, rising prices and invasions struck at the same time. The empire almost fell apart.",
